---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
---

<Base title="Terms and Conditions — Exporteller">
  <Section class="pt-16 pb-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <span class="inline-block rounded-[var(--radius-sm)] bg-accent-yellow px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-ink">
        Terms of Service
      </span>
      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-semibold sm:text-5xl">Terms and Conditions</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-ink-soft">
        Welcome to Exporteller's Terms of Service. By using our website, you agree to
        comply with the terms and conditions outlined below.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Services</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            Our platform enables businesses to connect with international buyers and
            expand their export operations. Key offerings include facilitating
            buyer-seller communication, processing orders, and providing support.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Communication</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            Users may contact us at
            <a href="mailto:hello@exporteller.com" class="text-brand-700 hover:underline">hello@exporteller.com</a>.
            You must provide accurate and complete information and maintain the security
            of your account.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Prohibited activities</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            Restrictions include posting false information, intellectual property
            infringement, harassment, and fraudulent conduct.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Intellectual property</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            All content on our website, including text, images, and logos, is the
            property of Exporteller or its licensors and is protected by copyright.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            Exporteller is not liable for any damages resulting from your use of our
            website or services.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Payments</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            We use Stripe for payment processing. Payments are made once the client
            receives the service, so there are no refunds available.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">How we work</h2>
          <ol class="mt-3 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5 text-ink-soft">
            <li>Initial contact.</li>
            <li>Google Meet consultation.</li>
            <li>Quote provision.</li>
            <li>Project confirmation.</li>
            <li>Service delivery.</li>
            <li>Payment via Stripe.</li>
          </ol>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-ink-soft">
            24A Trolley Square #1178, Wilmington, DE 19806-3334, U.S.A ·
            <a href="mailto:hello@exporteller.com" class="text-brand-700 hover:underline">hello@exporteller.com</a> ·
            <a href="https://wa.me/5493516133504" class="text-brand-700 hover:underline">+54 9 351 613 3504</a>
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section>
</Base>
